  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Solar Photovolatic, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solar Photovoltaic (PV) Reverse Trade Mission enabled USTDA to host Moroccan officials in charge of implementing a variety of solar PV projects so that the key decision-makers could meet with U.S. companies able to provide leading solar PV technology solutions; engineering, procurement, and contract services; and other relevant expertise. Delegates also visited U.S. solar PV facilities that are similar to those planned for development in Morocco. The visit connected the Moroccan project sponsors with U.S. expertise and financing sources.</narrative>
  </description>
